# 6. Test Schedule / Milestone
- Test Design & Script Development: 2 days (1 QA Engineer)
- Environment Setup: 1 day (DevOps + QA)
- Execution & Reporting: 2 days (QA Engineer)
- Total Duration: 5 days

# 7. Assumptions
- Jira access will be restored for future cycles.
- No business feature validation until requirements are available.

# 8. <Section Details>

# 9. Risk Mitigation Table
Risk ID | Description | Impact | Likelihood | Mitigation Action
---|---|---|---|---
R1 | Jira API authentication failures block test execution | High | High | Validate credentials pre-execution; implement retry logic; escalate to Jira admin if persistent
R2 | Issue description unavailable halts downstream processing | High | Medium | Gate workflow; alert stakeholders; pause pipeline for manual review
R3 | Fault injection tools may disrupt shared QA environments | Medium | Medium | Isolate test runs; schedule off-peak; coordinate with environment owners
R4 | Log aggregator misconfiguration leads to missed audit events | Medium | Low | Pre-validate log pipeline; monitor log ingestion; alert on missing events
R5 | Security sandbox not isolated from production data | High | Low | Use dedicated test data; enforce environment segregation

